 "cues": [
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "Your website works.",
   "start": 0.299,
   "end": 1.897
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "That doesn\u2019t mean it\u2019s safe.",
   "start": 2.335,
   "end": 3.683
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "Behind every page,\ncode runs out of sight.",
   "start": 3.999,
   "end": 6.424
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "Brain Code\u2019s PHP2Shell article\nexplores what happens",
   "start": 6.881,
   "end": 10.16
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "when AI helps uncover security flaws\nhiding in that foundation.",
   "start": 10.16,
   "end": 13.767
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "But discovery isn\u2019t protection.",
   "start": 13.897,
   "end": 15.84
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "A website can look perfectly normal",
   "start": 16.271,
   "end": 20.48
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "while the software underneath\nstill needs a security update.",
   "start": 20.48,
   "end": 24.697
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "The lesson? Check your PHP version\u2014\nnot just your plugins.",
   "start": 24.827,
   "end": 30.042
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "So what does PHP2Shell\nmean for your website\u2014",
   "start": 30.203,
   "end": 34.002
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "and where does AI fit into the story?",
   "start": 34.238,
   "end": 36.384
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "You\u2019ll find the link in the comments.",
